keyforge (0.3.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix GUI/session runtime state handling so partial status payloads preserve
    cached profile state.
  * Stop leaking active window data through active-profile status and
    reevaluation payloads.
  * Harden GUI async error handling and session reconnect behavior.

 -- nyrda <nyrda@keyforge.tools>  Mon, 13 Apr 2026 02:46:16 +0000

keyforge (0.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add first-class Niri compositor support, including direct action dispatch.
  * Expand superkeys into pattern and overload modes with stricter validation.
  * Make superkey bindings value-aware so wheel directions and similar inputs map cleanly.
  * Split stable tagged releases from manual prerelease packaging.

 -- nyrda <nyrda@keyforge.tools>  Fri, 10 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000

